Changes in LCS_Data_2 relative to LCS_Data_1.

Modification to PHTLIB:

Duplicate specification of the ground state of In-123
was removed.

Changes in LCS_Data_3 relative to LCS_Data_2.

Modification to BERTIN:

New LCS mass data tabulation added.
Maximum cross section tables added.

------------------------------------------------

The ASCI version of the original PHTLIB released with 
MCNPX 2.1.5 is distributed in mcnpx_2.4.0/Data/LCS/bcdlib.
The build procedure will create a binary phtlib file from
the bcdlib file using the hcnv program.

An alternate version of PHTLIB is now available.  
More information on this library is included in
the MCNPX2.3.0 report. See Section 4.3.1.5 on
page 54 of LA-UR-02-2607. It is included in this 
distribution in mcnpx_2.4.0/Data/LCS/bcdlib.spec1l.
